          "dir": "out",
          "direction": "in",
          "ended_at": null,
          "evidence_excerpt": "That framing explains why so much of the euro's crypto story in 2025–2026 is happening simultaneously at three distinct layers: the private stablecoin market, a consortium-banking effort to issue a MiCA-compliant euro stablecoin, and the European Central Bank's own digital euro project.",
          "from": "mica",
          "observed_at": "2026-06-18",
          "phrase": "Mentioned in this territory's explainer.",
          "relation_type": null,
          "role": null,
          "source": "observed_relation",
