          "description_source": "evidence",
          "dir": "out",
          "direction": "in",
          "ended_at": null,
          "evidence_excerpt": "Over the past decade it has evolved from a specialist multi-signature wallet provider into a federally chartered crypto bank, a MiCA-ready infrastructure partner in Europe, and a key player in the global shift toward regulated, prime-brokerage-style crypto market structure.",
          "from": "mica",
